aption></figure><p>Cybertruck 要停產了？馬斯克宣布明年拆除產線引熱議，訂單爆量緊急加班趕工！</p><p>【本文獲「COOL潮流生活網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:09.449978+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":959,"images":14,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:30:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:50:19.919393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:30.911666+00:00","content_hash":"79f09e6c949f40245c41e0058a9a5480e00bff74f5aebf405407ce37a3d68e0d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}